==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

